{"resourceIdentifier":"3395","resourceName":"Carbon Sink Afforestation Project in Tongyu County, Jilin Province","description":"Carbon Sink Afforestation Project (hereafter refer to as “the project”) in Tongyu County, Jilin Province is located in Tongyu County, Baicheng City, Jilin Province, and is organized and constructed by the Forestry and Grass Bureau of Tongyu County. Tongyu County is located in the western part of Jilin Province, adjacent to Inner Mongolia to the west and Heilongjiang to the north, and is located in the Songnen Plain in the east of the Greater Khingan Mountains.\r\nThe project aims to establish forests on barren land to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and contribute to local sustainable development.A total of 3,266.04 ha (48,990.6 Mu[ A Chinese metric unit of area, 1ha equals to 15 Mu.]) of forests were planted in 27 townships (towns and farms) in Tongyu County.\r\nThe project aims to bring into play the benefits of afforestation and sink, and at the same time, bring into play the multiple benefits of forests in terms of protecting biodiversity, improving local living environment and natural landscape, and increasing community income. Based on the crediting period of 20 years, a total of 1,175,818 tCO2e is expected to be generated by 2035, with an average annual emission reduction of 58,791 tCO2e.","location":{"latitude":44.813879,"longitude":123.087609},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-11-09","endExclusive":"2022-12-10","endInclusive":"2022-12-09"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3395"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"China, Tongyu County, Jilin Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Forestry Bureau of Tongyu County"},{"type":"string","value":"Tongyu County, China"},{"type":"string","value":"+86 13894690299"},{"type":"string","valu